 257:../Libraries/Service/Tricore/Math/Ifx_AngleTrkF32.c **** /** \brief Update the status flags.
 258:../Libraries/Service/Tricore/Math/Ifx_AngleTrkF32.c ****  * \param aObsv Pointer to the Ifx_AngleTrkF32 object
 259:../Libraries/Service/Tricore/Math/Ifx_AngleTrkF32.c ****  * \param sinIn Sinus value
