  25:../Libraries/Service/Tricore/Math/Ifx_LowPassPt1F32.h ****  *
  26:../Libraries/Service/Tricore/Math/Ifx_LowPassPt1F32.h ****  * \defgroup library_srvsw_sysse_math_f32_lowpasspt1 Low-pass Filter: Type PT1
  27:../Libraries/Service/Tricore/Math/Ifx_LowPassPt1F32.h ****  * This module implements a PT1 low pass filter.
  28:../Libraries/Service/Tricore/Math/Ifx_LowPassPt1F32.h ****  * http://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/PT1-Glied
  29:../Libraries/Service/Tricore/Math/Ifx_LowPassPt1F32.h ****  *
  30:../Libraries/Service/Tricore/Math/Ifx_LowPassPt1F32.h ****  * Formula: \n
  31:../Libraries/Service/Tricore/Math/Ifx_LowPassPt1F32.h ****  * \f$ y_k = y_{k-1} + a * x_k - b * y_{k-1} \f$ \n
  32:../Libraries/Service/Tricore/Math/Ifx_LowPassPt1F32.h ****  * with \f$(T^* = \frac{T_s}{T+T_s})\f$, \f$(a = K*T^*)\f$, \f$(b = T^*)\f$
  33:../Libraries/Service/Tricore/Math/Ifx_LowPassPt1F32.h ****  * with \f$(T_s: Sample time)\f$, \f$(K: Gain)\f$, \f$(T = \frac{1}{\omega_0})\f$
  34:../Libraries/Service/Tricore/Math/Ifx_LowPassPt1F32.h ****  *
  35:../Libraries/Service/Tricore/Math/Ifx_LowPassPt1F32.h ****  * \ingroup library_srvsw_sysse_math_f32
  36:../Libraries/Service/Tricore/Math/Ifx_LowPassPt1F32.h ****  *
  37:../Libraries/Service/Tricore/Math/Ifx_LowPassPt1F32.h ****  */
  38:../Libraries/Service/Tricore/Math/Ifx_LowPassPt1F32.h **** 
